# UI / data truth

Discover tabs/routes/widgets from App.tsx, registries, sidebar, query params, and the live DOM. Do not assume a fixed 22-tab count.

For data-bearing UI: HTTP 200 and a screenshot are not PASS. Compare visible fields to the same-session API. Disclose fallbacks (source, reason, age). Empty authentic data is empty, not success.

Local current UI: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/ui/` after proving the bound port. GCP `run.app` URLs are historical.
